SUMMARY:Titan Quest II
UID:1154030
DESCRIPTION:https://store.steampowered.com/app/1154030\n\nNemesis\, Goddess
  of Retribution\, is out of control. She is corrupting the Threads of Fate
  and punishing all those who oppose her. Take up your weapon\, fight 
 alongside gods\, and change fate itself in Titan Quest II\, an action RPG 
 inspired by Greek mythology.\n\nDate string from steam: "2025-08-01"
LAST-MODIFIED:20260925T040349Z
DTSTAMP:20260925T040349Z
CATEGORIES:game_release
END:VEVENT
